WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 19

01:27.800 --> 01:32.320
(Open and Noble)

01:34.020 --> 01:35.810
Do I have

01:37.690 --> 01:39.630
to send Yi back to her maiden home?

01:41.180 --> 01:43.370
Who said anything about that?

01:44.330 --> 01:45.260
Sometimes,

01:45.260 --> 01:46.950
I just get mad at you.

01:46.970 --> 01:49.500
Why do you always take her side?

01:56.330 --> 01:57.690
Son,

01:57.770 --> 01:59.650
what's wrong with you today?

02:00.020 --> 02:01.770
Before, whenever I asked you
to abandon her,

02:01.770 --> 02:03.580
you'd fight me to the end.

02:03.740 --> 02:04.740
Why did you

02:04.740 --> 02:07.070
bring it up yourself today?

02:07.090 --> 02:08.040
Aren't I just worried

02:08.040 --> 02:09.180
that you might act on impulse

02:09.180 --> 02:10.850
and actually send her back?

02:11.140 --> 02:12.790
If you were only saying it in anger,

02:12.810 --> 02:14.650
you should've told me sooner,

02:14.860 --> 02:16.470
so I wouldn't be so worried.

02:16.740 --> 02:18.280
If I told you,

02:18.300 --> 02:19.140
I'm afraid

02:19.140 --> 02:21.400
you'd run straight to Yi
and tell her everything.

02:21.420 --> 02:23.910
Then she'd become even more defiant,

02:23.930 --> 02:25.330
showing me

02:25.330 --> 02:26.630
even less respect.

02:26.650 --> 02:29.410
Fine, let's not mention that.

02:32.300 --> 02:33.140
She's always

02:33.140 --> 02:34.930
with her sister now.

02:35.980 --> 02:37.930
Even our relationship

02:38.500 --> 02:40.130
isn't as close as before.

02:40.150 --> 02:42.740
She's just an unmarried girl.

02:42.930 --> 02:44.350
One day,

02:44.370 --> 02:46.070
she'll return
to Earl Dongping's Mansion.

02:46.090 --> 02:47.650
She won't be here for long.

02:47.700 --> 02:49.530
You should hurry and send someone

02:49.530 --> 02:50.370
to find Qing'er.

02:50.370 --> 02:52.120
Where has she gone?

02:52.140 --> 02:53.500
Yes.

03:08.180 --> 03:09.650
Miss Jiang.

03:11.020 --> 03:12.120
Miss Jiang.

03:12.140 --> 03:14.410
It's you who saved me?

03:16.930 --> 03:18.840
Just as you predicted,

03:18.860 --> 03:20.250
Zhu Ziyu never intended

03:20.250 --> 03:21.780
to keep his promise.

03:21.860 --> 03:23.310
The moment he found me useless,

03:23.330 --> 03:24.850
he wanted to kill me.

03:25.810 --> 03:27.620
You saved my life.

03:27.620 --> 03:29.070
I will surely repay this debt.

03:29.090 --> 03:30.900
No need to be so formal.

03:31.090 --> 03:33.220
Let her be formal.

03:34.300 --> 03:36.370
We need your help with something.

03:47.740 --> 03:49.530
Is Qing'er taken care of?

03:50.020 --> 03:51.120
Yes.

03:51.140 --> 03:52.330
I've ensured

03:52.350 --> 03:54.850
that she vanished without a trace.

04:10.810 --> 04:12.550
Young Master, where is my sister?

04:12.570 --> 04:14.410
Please let her go.

04:22.450 --> 04:23.940
Deliver a letter for me.

04:26.740 --> 04:28.910
If you do as I say,

04:28.930 --> 04:30.600
once the task is done,

04:30.620 --> 04:32.780
not only will I let your sister go,

04:32.890 --> 04:34.810
but I will also grant her freedom.

04:35.180 --> 04:36.490
But if you can't even

04:36.490 --> 04:38.170
handle such a small matter,

04:40.540 --> 04:42.580
then consider

04:42.980 --> 04:44.730
what might happen to her.

04:47.930 --> 04:49.290
Very good.

05:08.620 --> 05:09.980
Miss Yu'er.

05:10.660 --> 05:12.900
Someone is waiting for you
in the carriage.

05:15.220 --> 05:16.580
Yu'er.

05:17.370 --> 05:18.430
Qing'er.

05:18.450 --> 05:20.170
Yu'er, get in.

05:30.250 --> 05:32.530
Qing'er, are you alright?

05:33.050 --> 05:34.450
Zhu Ziyu has promised me.

05:34.450 --> 05:36.340
Soon, he will set you free.

05:37.100 --> 05:38.790
But why are you

05:38.810 --> 05:40.550
with Miss Jiang?

05:40.570 --> 05:42.380
Set me free?

05:43.130 --> 05:44.100
In Zhu Ziyu's eyes,

05:44.100 --> 05:45.130
I am already

05:45.130 --> 05:46.670
a lifeless corpse.

05:46.690 --> 05:48.050
Of course, I am free.

05:48.450 --> 05:50.090
What do you mean?

05:50.110 --> 05:51.570
Zhu Ziyu feared my betrayal

05:51.570 --> 05:53.380
and tried to kill me.

05:53.490 --> 05:54.850
Luckily, Miss Jiang and Mr. Yu

05:54.850 --> 05:56.330
saved me despite our past grievances.

05:56.340 --> 05:57.250
Otherwise, you and I

05:57.250 --> 05:59.140
would've been separated by death.

06:00.370 --> 06:01.350
Yu'er,

06:01.370 --> 06:03.160
you seem to be in a hurry.

06:03.180 --> 06:04.200
Are you going

06:04.220 --> 06:06.410
to deliver a letter for Zhu Ziyu?

06:07.100 --> 06:08.530
This...

06:09.860 --> 06:10.890
It's alright, Yu'er.

06:10.890 --> 06:12.760
Zhu Ziyu is not to be trusted.

06:12.780 --> 06:14.790
Now, our only chance

06:14.810 --> 06:17.220
is to help Miss Jiang.

06:17.780 --> 06:19.650
Let's give the letter to her.

06:35.620 --> 06:38.290
The plan has changed.
Await further instructions.

06:41.420 --> 06:42.780
Wait.

06:44.490 --> 06:45.720
Don't worry, Yu'er.

06:45.740 --> 06:46.870
I have a way

06:46.890 --> 06:48.650
to set you two free.

07:13.660 --> 07:14.520
Miss,

07:14.540 --> 07:17.020
Zhu Ziyu sent Qing'er again.

07:17.810 --> 07:19.010
He said

07:19.010 --> 07:20.860
he was waiting for you
in a hidden house.

07:20.860 --> 07:22.160
He had something important to say

07:22.180 --> 07:24.410
and asked me to take you there.

07:40.050 --> 07:40.990
Mr. Zhu,

07:41.010 --> 07:42.550
the letter has been delivered.

07:42.570 --> 07:44.010
That lady said

07:44.010 --> 07:46.320
she was waiting for you
in a hidden house

07:46.340 --> 07:48.290
and asked me to bring you there.

07:54.540 --> 07:56.700
She's too eager.

08:39.250 --> 08:40.200
Mr. Zhu,

08:40.220 --> 08:42.300
the lady is inside.

08:54.650 --> 08:55.860
If it was just a rumor,

08:55.860 --> 08:58.350
how could I have returned unharmed?

08:58.370 --> 08:59.340
It's the abandoned house

08:59.340 --> 09:00.600
on Carp Lane ahead.

09:00.620 --> 09:03.700
A beauty awaits me.

09:05.460 --> 09:07.340
Who are you trying to fool?

09:07.420 --> 09:08.290
Has Mrs. Zhu Ziyu

09:08.290 --> 09:09.340
lost her mind?

09:09.340 --> 09:10.680
You don't believe me?

09:10.700 --> 09:12.600
Seeing is believing.

09:12.620 --> 09:14.850
I'll take you there myself.

09:15.130 --> 09:16.740
It's just ahead.

09:16.740 --> 09:18.100
We're almost there.

09:18.620 --> 09:19.980
Let's go.

09:23.940 --> 09:25.370
I miss you so much.

09:33.220 --> 09:35.090
Give me more time.

09:36.410 --> 09:38.060
I'll find a way

09:38.470 --> 09:40.250
to abandon Jiang Yi.

09:51.960 --> 09:53.320
No.

09:54.100 --> 09:55.610
I'll kill Jiang Yi.

09:57.010 --> 09:59.420
How much longer do I have to wait?

10:01.250 --> 10:03.060
If this continues,

10:03.460 --> 10:05.370
I might start to doubt

10:06.410 --> 10:07.410
how true

10:07.410 --> 10:09.420
your feelings for me are.

10:10.290 --> 10:11.250
(Before, )

10:11.250 --> 10:12.860
(to harm my sister, Cui Mingyue)

10:12.860 --> 10:14.320
(had been spying on the Zhu family)

10:14.340 --> 10:16.820
(but didn't collaborate with Zhu Ziyu.)

10:17.100 --> 10:18.270
(To my surprise, )

10:18.290 --> 10:20.250
(after all those changes, )

10:20.340 --> 10:21.920
(they ended up conspiring together)

10:21.940 --> 10:23.870
(to kill my sister.)

10:23.890 --> 10:25.060
Heaven and earth can testify

10:25.060 --> 10:26.520
to my feelings for you.

10:26.940 --> 10:29.010
But her sister is quite troublesome,

10:29.370 --> 10:30.340
and she has

10:30.340 --> 10:32.160
a skilled Commandant by her side.

10:32.940 --> 10:34.320
A Commandant?

10:34.340 --> 10:36.200
It's Yu Qi from Capital Security.

10:36.220 --> 10:37.580
Yu Qi?

10:37.980 --> 10:39.770
He's come to Lingshui?

10:40.650 --> 10:42.370
Do you know Yu Qi?

10:46.940 --> 10:48.850
How would I know him?

10:50.170 --> 10:51.530
Ziyu,

10:51.980 --> 10:53.660
are you saying

10:54.170 --> 10:56.420
as long as Jiang Si stays,

10:56.770 --> 10:58.890
you won't be able to make a move?

11:00.250 --> 11:01.890
She even ruined our meticulous plan

11:01.890 --> 11:03.610
at Yunshui Tower.

11:04.010 --> 11:05.850
I fear if we act recklessly,

11:06.530 --> 11:08.150
we'll leave evidence behind.

11:08.170 --> 11:10.320
Didn't Qing'er already reveal herself?

11:10.340 --> 11:12.580
Why still use her to pass messages?

11:12.890 --> 11:13.990
Don't worry.

11:14.010 --> 11:15.850
Qing'er has been killed.

11:15.980 --> 11:17.970
Since she's of no use,

11:18.060 --> 11:19.600
it's better she's gone for good.

11:19.620 --> 11:21.890
That's her twin sister, Yu'er.

11:22.010 --> 11:23.870
They just look alike.

11:23.890 --> 11:25.540
Once it's done,

11:26.530 --> 11:27.890
they won't be alive.

11:31.220 --> 11:32.580
What about Meng Nan

11:33.100 --> 11:34.680
from Caiyun Troupe?

11:34.700 --> 11:37.320
He said he'd stay by my side every day

11:37.340 --> 11:39.060
to cheer me up.

11:39.100 --> 11:40.180
How dare an actor

11:40.190 --> 11:42.210
like him entertain such fantasies?

11:42.230 --> 11:44.220
How dare a lowly man

11:44.240 --> 11:46.700
like him stain your eyes?

11:46.820 --> 11:49.750
He's good at drumming

11:49.770 --> 11:52.010
and has a bit of charm.

11:52.370 --> 11:54.610
He's kept around

11:54.650 --> 11:56.490
for amusement.

11:57.340 --> 11:58.320
After all,

11:58.340 --> 12:00.680
you can't be with me every day.

12:00.700 --> 12:02.250
I want to be with you day and night,

12:02.250 --> 12:03.730
forever and always.

12:04.060 --> 12:07.340
Your Grace, you promised me

12:07.620 --> 12:09.770
you'd marry me, right?

12:11.340 --> 12:12.220
You can never

12:12.220 --> 12:14.300
look at other men again.

12:15.770 --> 12:16.610
It's just ahead.

12:16.610 --> 12:17.520
We're almost there.

12:17.530 --> 12:19.820
Meng is a fool.

12:20.410 --> 12:21.370
I had him spread rumors

12:21.370 --> 12:23.090
about Jiang Yi,

12:23.170 --> 12:25.130
and he actually did it.

12:25.940 --> 12:28.420
I'm just afraid
he'll blurt out the truth

12:28.530 --> 12:29.530
if he's arrested.

12:29.530 --> 12:31.180
What truth?

12:31.430 --> 12:32.370
Since the beginning,

12:32.370 --> 12:34.320
he's never seen my true face.

12:34.340 --> 12:35.460
You've never appeared either.

12:35.460 --> 12:37.390
It was always Qing'er passing messages.

12:37.410 --> 12:38.890
Are you scared?

12:40.010 --> 12:41.440
As you wish.

12:41.460 --> 12:43.130
- It's here.
- It's here.

12:44.340 --> 12:45.700
Push the door open.

12:47.410 --> 12:49.290
You've brought them here?

12:49.310 --> 12:50.940
- Don't worry. I'm here.
- Open the door.

12:50.940 --> 12:53.180
- Open the door!
- Open the door!

13:02.460 --> 13:04.230
We can't leave from both doors now.

13:04.250 --> 13:06.180
There's even nowhere to hide.

13:06.250 --> 13:08.040
You fool, we're trapped.

13:08.060 --> 13:09.420
Let's go.

13:15.530 --> 13:17.740
- Meng Nan.
- It's a man

13:17.740 --> 13:19.370
meeting with Mr. Meng?

13:20.100 --> 13:21.970
Aren't you blind?

13:22.410 --> 13:24.370
Don't you see the woman behind him?

13:24.530 --> 13:25.370
Oh.

13:25.380 --> 13:26.220
Indeed.

13:26.220 --> 13:27.700
Who are you?

13:27.720 --> 13:28.800
This is my family's place.

13:28.810 --> 13:30.270
Get lost now!

13:31.370 --> 13:33.540
Darling, are you alright?

13:35.820 --> 13:37.170
Don't leave yet.

13:37.170 --> 13:38.530
Yi.

13:38.740 --> 13:41.010
Was Ziyu calling for you just now?

13:45.860 --> 13:48.350
- Yi.
- You're keeping a mistress secretly.

13:48.370 --> 13:50.230
Now that you've been caught,

13:50.250 --> 13:51.460
you're using my sister

13:51.460 --> 13:53.130
as a shield?

13:53.580 --> 13:55.890
Honey, I see. You love someone else.

13:56.580 --> 13:58.170
Is it because of her

13:58.190 --> 13:59.400
that you went to such lengths

13:59.410 --> 14:00.680
to harm me?

14:00.700 --> 14:03.590
Yi, it's a misunderstanding.

14:03.610 --> 14:05.340
Don't listen
to your sister's instigation.

14:05.340 --> 14:06.190
At this point,

14:06.190 --> 14:08.300
how dare you say I'm instigating this?

14:08.460 --> 14:10.140
A lone man and a woman
in a secret alley.

14:10.140 --> 14:11.660
What misunderstanding could there be?

14:11.660 --> 14:12.920
Explain yourself.

14:12.940 --> 14:14.960
Let everyone judge.

14:14.980 --> 14:16.490
Right.

14:17.700 --> 14:19.090
Miss,

14:19.290 --> 14:20.680
how long do you plan to hide?

14:20.700 --> 14:22.740
You dared to meet with a married man,

14:22.740 --> 14:24.770
but you lack the courage to admit it?

14:24.940 --> 14:26.390
Let everyone see

14:26.410 --> 14:28.700
whose daughter this is.

14:33.340 --> 14:36.750
Jiang Si, how dare you.

14:36.770 --> 14:38.630
Who could be as bold as you?

14:38.650 --> 14:39.870
You know her?

14:39.890 --> 14:41.700
Cui Mingyue.

14:43.410 --> 14:46.350
How powerful the Grand Princess is.

14:46.370 --> 14:48.660
You've kept the news so well.

14:48.740 --> 14:49.620
Not long ago,

14:49.620 --> 14:51.510
Cui Mingyue attempted
to kill my brother,

14:51.530 --> 14:53.250
so she was demoted by His Majesty.

14:53.250 --> 14:54.860
Now, she's even more resentful

14:54.860 --> 14:56.460
toward our family.

14:56.740 --> 14:58.700
Do you really think

14:58.890 --> 15:01.850
the only daughter of the Grand Princess

15:02.100 --> 15:04.090
would like you?

15:05.250 --> 15:07.080
Which one do you trust, her or me?

15:07.100 --> 15:08.460
It's up to you.

15:20.010 --> 15:21.370
Let go.

15:25.370 --> 15:27.090
Since you've seen

15:29.170 --> 15:31.180
that Mingyue and I are in love,

15:33.370 --> 15:35.220
let's part on good terms.

16:22.060 --> 16:23.420
(It's her.)

16:23.490 --> 16:25.010
(The Grand Princess.)

16:27.460 --> 16:28.820
Mother.

16:35.060 --> 16:36.390
Your Highness.

16:36.410 --> 16:38.750
Mingyue and I are in love.

16:38.770 --> 16:40.060
I hope you can approve.

16:40.060 --> 16:40.960
Mother,

16:40.980 --> 16:42.900
I was deceived by Zhu Ziyu.

16:42.920 --> 16:44.020
When I first arrived here,

16:44.020 --> 16:45.290
he showered me with sweet words

16:45.290 --> 16:46.630
and was persistent and clingy.

16:46.650 --> 16:48.820
Mother, please believe me.

16:50.860 --> 16:54.250
Zhu Ziyu, be wise.

16:54.820 --> 16:56.670
If you dare to pester her again,

16:56.690 --> 16:59.660
I'll take your life.

17:02.100 --> 17:03.520
Your Highness,

17:03.540 --> 17:05.770
shielding the County Princess like this

17:05.970 --> 17:07.630
is aiding evil.

17:07.650 --> 17:09.000
How dare you!

17:09.020 --> 17:11.410
The County Princess
disregards others' lives,

17:11.410 --> 17:12.710
treating them like ants.

17:12.730 --> 17:14.320
One day, this will lead

17:14.340 --> 17:16.250
to a mistake that can't be undone.

17:16.370 --> 17:18.130
Are you teaching me

17:18.130 --> 17:20.250
how to discipline my daughter?

17:20.690 --> 17:22.910
You know the best how His Majesty

17:22.930 --> 17:24.840
dealt with the only son
of Marquis Changxing

17:24.860 --> 17:26.800
when he made a mistake.

17:26.820 --> 17:28.240
Jiang Si, you're bold.

17:28.260 --> 17:29.670
The County Princess said

17:29.690 --> 17:30.930
Zhu Ziyu deceived you

17:30.930 --> 17:32.150
with sweet words,

17:32.170 --> 17:33.080
but I think

17:33.100 --> 17:34.780
this was a trap

17:34.780 --> 17:36.080
you carefully set up

17:36.100 --> 17:37.730
for my sister

17:37.730 --> 17:39.560
to avenge your demotion.

17:39.580 --> 17:41.670
You're sharp-tongued,

17:41.690 --> 17:43.700
but I detest

17:43.820 --> 17:46.180
being threatened.

17:48.210 --> 17:49.570
Stop!

17:53.820 --> 17:55.390
What are you trying to do?

17:59.820 --> 18:01.770
You must be Yu Qi.

18:02.370 --> 18:03.340
Is Lingshui also

18:03.340 --> 18:05.280
under the control of Capital Security?

18:05.300 --> 18:06.840
We're not like you

18:06.860 --> 18:08.500
who can rule

18:08.500 --> 18:10.170
and domineer over everyone

18:10.170 --> 18:11.770
inside or outside Ling'an.

18:12.410 --> 18:14.350
Yu Qi, how dare you

18:14.350 --> 18:15.710
speak ill of the Grand Princess?

18:15.730 --> 18:17.090
I wouldn't dare.

18:17.690 --> 18:19.210
I can't ignore the law

18:19.210 --> 18:20.810
like the County Princess.

18:22.620 --> 18:24.170
Let me remind you.

18:24.170 --> 18:25.690
His Majesty has had a verdict

18:25.690 --> 18:27.420
on the Jinshui River Case.

18:27.620 --> 18:30.420
Mingyue is merely a victim.

18:31.620 --> 18:33.390
What happened today is already clear.

18:33.410 --> 18:35.520
If you keep quiet,

18:35.540 --> 18:38.000
I'll have no interest

18:38.020 --> 18:39.730
in your lives.

18:51.730 --> 18:53.040
(Since I can't avoid it, )

18:53.060 --> 18:55.570
(I'll have to be ready for the battle.)

18:58.300 --> 19:01.730
Yi, I was blind.

19:02.780 --> 19:04.380
Please forgive me.

19:04.450 --> 19:05.970
As you wish,

19:07.410 --> 19:08.810
let's part ways.

19:09.480 --> 19:14.000
(Zhu Mansion)

19:14.080 --> 19:15.970
(Mr. Zhu)

19:15.970 --> 19:17.040
You wretched child!

19:17.060 --> 19:19.350
Bring the family punishment!

19:19.370 --> 19:20.730
Today,

19:21.100 --> 19:22.650
I must beat this son to death

19:22.650 --> 19:24.320
to uphold our reputation.

19:24.340 --> 19:26.240
- Honey.
- Don't interfere.

19:26.260 --> 19:27.970
It's all your indulgence.

19:34.970 --> 19:36.330
Yi,

19:37.300 --> 19:38.710
don't worry.

19:38.730 --> 19:40.430
I'll make sure this is resolved,

19:40.450 --> 19:42.010
and justice will be served.

19:43.450 --> 19:45.180
I only wish to part ways.

19:47.060 --> 19:49.010
Yi, get up.

19:53.020 --> 19:54.350
Yi,

19:54.370 --> 19:55.560
my son Yu

19:55.580 --> 19:57.580
has committed an unforgivable sin.

19:57.580 --> 20:00.000
But, as you've not thought of yourself,

20:00.020 --> 20:02.260
you should at least think of Yan.

20:02.260 --> 20:03.580
After all, you're married.

20:03.580 --> 20:05.770
What's so hard to overcome?

20:07.260 --> 20:08.430
Yan...

20:08.450 --> 20:09.760
Mr. Zhu,

20:09.780 --> 20:11.280
if we're talking about justice,

20:11.300 --> 20:12.070
this matter

20:12.070 --> 20:13.100
should've been dealt with

20:13.100 --> 20:14.010
at the court.

20:14.010 --> 20:14.930
I...

20:14.930 --> 20:16.500
It's because of Yan

20:16.520 --> 20:17.600
that my sister would rather

20:17.600 --> 20:19.000
discuss this privately.

20:19.020 --> 20:20.710
With the current situation,

20:20.730 --> 20:23.100
we must take Yan with us.

20:25.780 --> 20:27.760
What right does an unmarried girl

20:27.780 --> 20:29.170
like you have

20:29.170 --> 20:31.380
to make decisions for your sister?

20:35.620 --> 20:36.760
Yi,

20:36.780 --> 20:38.000
I know

20:38.020 --> 20:39.900
you won't be so cruel

20:40.410 --> 20:41.730
to do this.

20:41.730 --> 20:42.760
Right?

20:42.780 --> 20:44.840
What will happen to a woman

20:44.860 --> 20:46.190
like you with a daughter

20:46.210 --> 20:48.060
after the divorce?

20:48.060 --> 20:50.240
There's no need for you to worry.

20:50.260 --> 20:52.240
Our family is declining,

20:52.260 --> 20:54.460
but we can accommodate Yi.

20:56.410 --> 20:57.770
Son,

20:58.100 --> 21:00.730
kowtow and apologize to Yi,

21:01.130 --> 21:03.330
and promise it won't happen again.

21:03.620 --> 21:04.980
Yi,

21:06.410 --> 21:07.930
I was vile and despicable.

21:07.930 --> 21:09.660
I've betrayed you.

21:11.780 --> 21:12.800
Yi,

21:12.820 --> 21:14.700
please give me one more chance.

21:16.370 --> 21:17.820
You tried to kill your wife

21:17.820 --> 21:19.170
and committed adultery with a lady.

21:19.170 --> 21:21.050
You're truly despicable.

21:21.300 --> 21:22.210
Since my sister

21:22.210 --> 21:23.170
has now seen

21:23.170 --> 21:24.390
your true face,

21:24.410 --> 21:25.970
how could she give you another chance

21:25.970 --> 21:27.940
to continue your marriage?

21:31.370 --> 21:32.850
Tried to kill his wife?

21:32.870 --> 21:34.340
You can't make baseless accusations.

21:34.340 --> 21:35.560
Mr. Zhu,

21:35.580 --> 21:36.540
not long ago,

21:36.540 --> 21:38.260
my sister almost lost her life

21:38.260 --> 21:39.300
when a horse ran wild

21:39.300 --> 21:41.100
on the road to Cloud Temple.

21:41.340 --> 21:43.280
Have you investigated

21:43.300 --> 21:44.970
the truth behind this?

21:45.210 --> 21:46.570
Well...

21:47.370 --> 21:49.110
I've long suspected

21:49.130 --> 21:50.860
the mastermind behind that

21:50.860 --> 21:52.350
was Zhu Ziyu.

21:52.370 --> 21:54.140
At that time,

21:54.140 --> 21:55.350
Commandant Yu was also there,

21:55.370 --> 21:57.110
witnessing the whole incident.

21:57.130 --> 21:58.000
Mr. Zhu,

21:58.020 --> 21:59.480
have you thought this through?

21:59.500 --> 22:01.300
If you don't agree to divorce,

22:01.300 --> 22:02.650
we'll take accident

22:02.650 --> 22:04.860
to the court.

22:05.010 --> 22:05.890
If it turns out

22:05.890 --> 22:08.080
to be related to Zhu Ziyu,

22:08.100 --> 22:10.570
then you and your son's careers...

22:13.450 --> 22:15.760
You'd better write
the Letter of Divorce now.

22:15.780 --> 22:16.840
From now on,

22:16.860 --> 22:18.430
my sister and your son

22:18.450 --> 22:19.240
will part ways,

22:19.240 --> 22:20.500
no longer involved in marriage,

22:20.500 --> 22:21.630
death, or anything else.

22:21.650 --> 22:24.460
Otherwise, we'll meet in court.

22:29.300 --> 22:31.010
Since she wants a divorce,

22:31.130 --> 22:32.730
let's grant her wish.

22:33.300 --> 22:34.210
Didn't you always want

22:34.210 --> 22:35.770
to get rid of her, Mother?

22:35.860 --> 22:37.480
Today is just the right day.

22:37.500 --> 22:38.970
And Yan

22:39.500 --> 22:41.290
is just a girl.

22:41.370 --> 22:43.220
She'll marry into another family.

22:43.370 --> 22:44.300
If they want her,

22:44.300 --> 22:46.040
let them take her.

22:46.060 --> 22:48.290
We can't let this go to the court

22:48.410 --> 22:49.840
and ruin my future.

22:49.860 --> 22:51.220
You...

22:52.450 --> 22:53.810
This...

23:02.470 --> 23:07.830
♪ Life is like flowers,
blooming and fading with the seasons ♪

23:09.000 --> 23:14.170
♪ Wind leaves marks,
swaying in the breeze ♪

23:14.750 --> 23:18.160
♪ I don't wish for favors
from the heavens ♪

23:18.820 --> 23:20.180
Yi...

23:21.120 --> 23:27.860
♪ I only wish to be unburdened ♪

23:28.310 --> 23:33.490
♪ Fate's been written; we're its slaves ♪

23:34.710 --> 23:39.390
♪ I dare not look back
at the road I came from ♪

23:39.390 --> 23:43.080
(Letter of Divorce)

23:43.440 --> 23:46.560
♪ I only wish to wake up one day ♪

23:46.560 --> 23:50.080
(Our daughter)

23:53.040 --> 23:59.470
♪ Alas, is it too late
to stop indulging myself ♪

23:59.490 --> 24:01.600
♪ Is it too difficult ♪

24:01.620 --> 24:04.180
I, Zhu Ziyu, with my wife, Jiang,

24:04.340 --> 24:07.730
think differently,
and it's hard to reconcile.

24:07.890 --> 24:09.770
We seek a separation.

24:09.890 --> 24:11.710
This document is written

24:11.730 --> 24:13.380
to affirm our parting.

24:13.500 --> 24:15.040
Our daughter

24:15.060 --> 24:16.600
and boat of her dowry

24:16.620 --> 24:18.330
will be with Jiang.

24:18.450 --> 24:20.430
Our future marriages

24:20.450 --> 24:22.290
won't be subject to disputes.

24:22.340 --> 24:24.010
For future evidence,

24:24.210 --> 24:26.810
I volunteer to write this contract.

24:29.210 --> 24:30.570
Miss,

24:30.820 --> 24:32.040
the rain has stopped,

24:32.060 --> 24:33.530
and the sky is clear.

25:27.730 --> 25:29.240
Qing'er, you go first.

25:29.260 --> 25:30.600
If Zhu Ziyu catches you,

25:30.620 --> 25:32.020
he won't let you go.

25:32.040 --> 25:34.350
Yu'er, what will you do if I leave?

25:34.370 --> 25:35.450
As long as you're well,

25:35.450 --> 25:37.420
I'll be content.

25:37.690 --> 25:39.560
My deed is still in his hands.

25:39.580 --> 25:40.630
In this life,

25:40.650 --> 25:42.080
I fear I'll be trapped here.

25:42.100 --> 25:44.220
Give me Yu'er's deed.

25:45.020 --> 25:46.350
What?

25:46.370 --> 25:47.300
What Yu'er?

25:47.300 --> 25:48.390
Continue.

25:48.410 --> 25:50.530
Don't! I'll give it to you.

25:58.410 --> 25:59.340
From now on,

25:59.340 --> 26:01.390
if you dare to trouble them,

26:01.410 --> 26:02.860
it'll be more than a beating.

26:02.860 --> 26:04.220
Let's go.

26:28.410 --> 26:29.710
Yu'er.

26:29.730 --> 26:31.330
- Miss Si.
- Miss Si.

26:32.370 --> 26:34.050
This is your deed.

26:35.340 --> 26:36.410
From now on,

26:36.410 --> 26:37.710
(Deed of Person)
you two

26:37.730 --> 26:39.290
are free.

26:40.130 --> 26:44.380
- Thank you, Miss Si.
- Get up.

26:49.370 --> 26:52.100
Your Grace.

26:55.890 --> 26:57.250
Your Grace.

26:57.500 --> 26:58.970
I knew it.

26:59.020 --> 27:00.950
You were just afraid
of the Grand Princess

27:00.970 --> 27:02.460
to admit it,

27:03.380 --> 27:05.630
but you still have feelings
for me, right?

27:07.100 --> 27:08.700
What a fool.

27:09.300 --> 27:11.330
You really think I'd care for you?

27:15.500 --> 27:16.630
But I've been sincere

27:16.650 --> 27:18.860
to you, Your Grace.

27:20.500 --> 27:21.450
You even tried

27:21.450 --> 27:22.910
to kill your wife.

27:22.930 --> 27:24.970
How can you be sincere?

27:25.100 --> 27:27.620
I've seen plenty

27:27.620 --> 27:29.620
of snobs like you.

27:29.890 --> 27:31.660
A little benefit is enough

27:31.730 --> 27:33.250
to entice you.

27:33.580 --> 27:35.010
Unfortunately,

27:35.300 --> 27:38.050
you failed to kill Jiang Yi.

27:39.890 --> 27:41.330
But

27:42.410 --> 27:45.010
watching your marriage fall apart,

27:45.300 --> 27:48.180
and seeing how desperate Jiang Yi is,

27:50.100 --> 27:52.570
I found it quite amusing.

27:57.170 --> 27:59.490
You played me like a puppet

27:59.730 --> 28:01.810
and caused my family to fall apart

28:03.370 --> 28:05.330
just for amusement?

28:06.500 --> 28:07.900
What else?

28:09.020 --> 28:10.860
Life is long,

28:11.060 --> 28:13.010
and I have everything I need.

28:13.030 --> 28:14.130
Of course, I need something

28:14.130 --> 28:15.810
to entertain myself.

28:16.140 --> 28:17.730
Zhu Ziyu,

28:18.340 --> 28:19.810
you've seen it.

28:20.780 --> 28:22.660
People who offend me

28:23.060 --> 28:25.420
never end well.

28:25.930 --> 28:27.460
So,

28:27.690 --> 28:30.290
just give me what I want,

28:30.450 --> 28:31.970
or else,

28:32.410 --> 28:36.570
a broken family is just the beginning.

28:39.620 --> 28:42.100
If all your family is killed...

28:44.020 --> 28:45.860
What do you think?

29:03.820 --> 29:06.140
That's more like it.

29:34.360 --> 29:39.080
(Fenglin Inn)

29:39.340 --> 29:43.250
Aunt, which one
do you think is prettier?

29:43.890 --> 29:45.520
I think these two are pretty.

29:45.540 --> 29:47.700
Then let's have them stand together.

29:49.370 --> 29:50.350
Aunt.

29:50.370 --> 29:52.280
- Yan, wait.
- What do you think...

29:52.300 --> 29:53.870
Eat this wonton first.

29:53.890 --> 29:54.730
Sure.

29:54.740 --> 29:57.100
What should you say at this moment?

29:57.580 --> 29:58.950
Thank you, Brother.

29:58.970 --> 30:00.810
I'm not your brother.

30:00.860 --> 30:01.820
I'm about the same age

30:01.820 --> 30:03.700
as your aunt,

30:03.890 --> 30:05.150
so you should call me Uncle.

30:05.170 --> 30:07.810
That's Aunt, and I'm Uncle.

30:08.130 --> 30:10.140
Thank you, Uncle.

30:10.340 --> 30:11.450
- Good girl.
- Good girl.

30:11.450 --> 30:12.480
Here.

30:12.500 --> 30:13.810
Let me feed you.

30:13.810 --> 30:14.730
Good.

30:14.730 --> 30:16.770
Be careful. It's hot.

30:18.340 --> 30:20.490
Take a sip of the soup.

30:37.060 --> 30:39.430
Uncle is too busy looking at Aunt

30:39.450 --> 30:41.490
to notice the wonton.

30:43.760 --> 30:44.640
I didn't have time...

30:44.650 --> 30:45.910
Alright, Yan.

30:45.930 --> 30:47.290
Commandant Yu,

30:47.450 --> 30:49.480
thank you for your help these days.

30:49.500 --> 30:51.180
You're too kind.

30:52.300 --> 30:53.970
Protecting the people

30:53.970 --> 30:55.110
is the duty

30:55.130 --> 30:56.820
of Capital Security.

30:56.820 --> 30:57.820
Besides, Jiang Zhan and I

30:57.820 --> 30:59.480
are close friends.

30:59.500 --> 31:01.710
His family is my family.

31:01.730 --> 31:03.020
Zhan is so lucky to have

31:03.020 --> 31:04.430
a friend like you.

31:04.450 --> 31:05.690
I'm also lucky to have

31:05.690 --> 31:07.330
a friend like him.

31:21.820 --> 31:23.970
It's fine. There's no redness.

31:24.540 --> 31:26.010
Let me blow it for you.

31:34.730 --> 31:36.320
From now on,

31:36.340 --> 31:39.000
I'll leave those two in your care.

31:39.020 --> 31:39.920
Don't worry.

31:39.940 --> 31:40.780
With me here,

31:40.780 --> 31:42.530
they'll have food to eat.

31:44.020 --> 31:45.320
Miss Si,

31:45.340 --> 31:46.700
actually,

31:47.260 --> 31:48.500
I've always wanted to give you

31:48.500 --> 31:49.860
this painting.

31:51.930 --> 31:53.490
What's this?

31:54.260 --> 31:55.480
Since you asked,

31:55.500 --> 31:57.460
I'll tell you honestly.

31:58.100 --> 32:00.530
The reason why I saved your sister

32:00.690 --> 32:02.000
is for righteousness

32:02.020 --> 32:03.570
and to repay kindness.

32:04.060 --> 32:05.190
To repay kindness?

32:05.210 --> 32:06.670
A life-saving kindness.

32:06.690 --> 32:08.390
Your mother, Su Ke,

32:08.410 --> 32:10.730
once saved my life.

32:10.970 --> 32:12.530
My mother?

32:13.060 --> 32:14.630
My parents died when I was young.

32:14.650 --> 32:16.190
Before they passed,

32:16.210 --> 32:18.460
they entrusted me to Caiyun Troupe.

32:18.650 --> 32:21.630
When I was just past my coming-of-age,

32:21.650 --> 32:23.520
they bullied me for being young

32:23.540 --> 32:25.100
and alone.

32:25.540 --> 32:26.710
I couldn't fight back,

32:26.730 --> 32:28.210
but I didn't want

32:28.210 --> 32:30.100
to yield to them,

32:30.210 --> 32:31.370
so, in a fit of anger,

32:31.370 --> 32:33.010
I ran away from the troupe.

32:33.260 --> 32:34.300
But I didn't expect

32:34.300 --> 32:36.280
to meet a human trafficker on the way

32:36.300 --> 32:38.100
and almost got beaten to death.

32:38.450 --> 32:39.480
Fortunately,

32:39.500 --> 32:41.660
I was saved by Su Ke.

32:42.350 --> 32:43.640
- Help me!
- You can't escape!

32:43.650 --> 32:45.640
(Su Ke, Jiang Si's mother)
Help me!

32:49.120 --> 32:49.970
Mr. Cui.

32:49.970 --> 32:51.860
- Get lost.
- Yes.

32:53.130 --> 32:54.430
Miss,

32:54.450 --> 32:55.630
are you alright?

32:55.650 --> 32:56.720
Miss?

32:56.740 --> 32:57.870
- Miss?
- Miss?

32:57.890 --> 33:00.900
The year Su Ke took me in

33:01.020 --> 33:03.140
was the happiest time of my life.

33:11.890 --> 33:14.110
Su was a lady

33:14.130 --> 33:15.760
but she took in an actress.

33:16.340 --> 33:19.010
Many people were gossiping about it.

33:19.130 --> 33:21.390
Her father wanted to send me away,

33:21.410 --> 33:23.040
but Su said

33:23.060 --> 33:24.780
that they could gossip if they wanted,

33:24.780 --> 33:26.420
and we shouldn't care.

33:26.580 --> 33:27.910
Even if she sent me away,

33:27.930 --> 33:30.320
they still wouldn't stop.

33:30.340 --> 33:32.840
Though Su didn't care,

33:32.860 --> 33:35.280
I didn't want to trouble her,

33:35.300 --> 33:37.290
so I returned to Caiyun Troupe.

33:37.860 --> 33:40.240
But her words

33:40.260 --> 33:42.290
really enlightened me.

33:42.340 --> 33:43.760
After that,

33:43.780 --> 33:44.820
I no longer let rumors

33:44.820 --> 33:46.760
affect me.

33:46.780 --> 33:48.240
I promised her

33:48.260 --> 33:49.870
that when I returned,

33:49.890 --> 33:51.100
I would perform

33:51.100 --> 33:53.180
the most beautiful dance for her.

33:55.340 --> 33:56.320
Thank you,

33:56.340 --> 33:57.700
Ms. Fei,

33:58.100 --> 33:59.930
for telling me so much.

34:00.540 --> 34:02.370
I lost my mother

34:02.690 --> 34:04.370
right after I was born,

34:04.900 --> 34:06.330
and I have

34:07.020 --> 34:08.810
never met her.

34:09.580 --> 34:11.370
All these years,

34:11.610 --> 34:13.010
I've only been able to picture her

34:13.010 --> 34:14.730
from others'

34:14.810 --> 34:16.620
fragments of words.

34:18.060 --> 34:19.420
Ms. Fei,

34:19.460 --> 34:21.060
I envy you

34:21.580 --> 34:23.700
for how you got to spend

34:23.810 --> 34:25.980
so much time with her.

34:26.210 --> 34:29.500
The world is vast. We'll meet again.

35:03.680 --> 35:05.440
(Fenglin Inn)

35:05.460 --> 35:06.480
Yan, slow down.

35:06.500 --> 35:07.860
Be careful.

35:16.330 --> 35:18.410
You go ahead and leave first.

35:18.580 --> 35:19.940
Yes.

35:23.980 --> 35:25.340
Mr. Yu.

35:27.460 --> 35:29.080
I have something I don't understand.

35:29.100 --> 35:30.310
Before we leave,

35:30.330 --> 35:31.580
I want to ask you.

35:31.580 --> 35:32.920
Go ahead.

35:32.940 --> 35:33.980
The person observing

35:33.980 --> 35:36.290
in the woods that day was you, right?

35:53.650 --> 35:55.110
You must've made a mistake.

35:55.130 --> 35:57.310
That day, I was on patrol elsewhere

35:57.330 --> 35:58.420
and only rushed over

35:58.420 --> 36:00.230
when I heard the startled horse.

36:02.850 --> 36:06.410
You said I risked my life to save them,

36:06.690 --> 36:08.890
but you did the same thing.

36:23.000 --> 36:26.200
(Border of Ling'an)

36:26.200 --> 36:29.680
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

36:33.980 --> 36:35.480
Greetings, Grandmother.

36:35.500 --> 36:36.360
Yan,

36:36.380 --> 36:38.250
kowtow to your great-grandmother.

36:49.800 --> 36:51.230
Si,

36:51.250 --> 36:53.700
you really have grown bold.

36:53.850 --> 36:54.730
Now, is the family

36:54.730 --> 36:57.250
under your control?

36:57.770 --> 36:59.730
This is serious,

36:59.850 --> 37:00.980
but you didn't even inform

37:00.980 --> 37:01.980
your father and brother.

37:01.980 --> 37:03.400
How can you

37:03.420 --> 37:04.420
bring them back

37:04.420 --> 37:06.360
without telling anyone?

37:06.380 --> 37:08.530
Grandmother, it was my decision.

37:08.550 --> 37:10.480
Si just couldn't bear to refuse me.

37:10.500 --> 37:12.960
Alright, don't speak for her.

37:12.980 --> 37:15.540
I know both of your tempers.

37:17.100 --> 37:18.460
Mother,

37:18.980 --> 37:20.880
this must be handled swiftly.

37:20.900 --> 37:23.130
Yi has suffered greatly.

37:23.130 --> 37:24.730
That Si saved Yi

37:24.730 --> 37:26.330
from danger

37:26.330 --> 37:28.520
is what matters.

37:28.540 --> 37:30.890
It's understandable

37:30.910 --> 37:32.950
that she didn't have time to tell us.

37:34.770 --> 37:36.110
Both of you

37:36.130 --> 37:37.080
are home now.

37:37.080 --> 37:38.250
Si's engagement was canceled,

37:38.250 --> 37:39.850
and Yi got a divorce.

37:40.210 --> 37:42.700
What misdeeds have we done?

37:42.850 --> 37:44.110
Grandmother,

37:44.130 --> 37:45.420
it was Ji and Zhu

37:45.420 --> 37:46.760
who had done misdeeds,

37:46.780 --> 37:48.520
not Yi and Si.

37:48.540 --> 37:50.710
I will uphold our family,

37:50.730 --> 37:53.290
and no one will bully our girls again.

37:58.850 --> 38:00.930
Yan, come on. Get up.

38:01.420 --> 38:03.600
Go greet your great-grandmother.

38:03.620 --> 38:05.020
Go on.

38:11.980 --> 38:14.330
Great-grandmother.

38:16.690 --> 38:19.850
Let me hold your hands, okay?

38:21.690 --> 38:23.540
Yi, get up.

38:25.330 --> 38:28.020
Please have two little red fruits,

38:28.250 --> 38:30.020
one in each hand.

38:30.810 --> 38:32.290
Hold them carefully.

38:32.460 --> 38:33.820
Go on.

38:41.170 --> 38:45.100
You have your happy lives to live.

38:45.650 --> 38:48.220
From now on,

38:48.900 --> 38:50.980
I won't interfere with your matters.

38:55.480 --> 38:58.320
(Morning Drizzle)

38:58.320 --> 39:02.000
(Haitang Chamber)

39:06.360 --> 39:08.000
(The past is
like autumn leaves falling.)

39:08.000 --> 39:10.860
(There's still enough time
to resolve every difficulty.)

39:14.580 --> 39:16.150
You're lying to me, right?

39:16.170 --> 39:17.850
Why would the Grand Princess
kill Yu Qi?

39:17.850 --> 39:19.080
She's got what she wants.

39:19.100 --> 39:20.540
Why would I lie to you?

39:20.770 --> 39:22.630
Dazhou couldn't conquer Nanwu

39:22.650 --> 39:24.040
and recently suffered a defeat.

39:24.060 --> 39:25.480
The Grand Princess blamed everything

39:25.480 --> 39:26.480
on Chiyu Cavalry

39:26.500 --> 39:27.880
and beheaded

39:27.900 --> 39:29.330
their leader, Yu Qi.

39:30.770 --> 39:32.580
- Junior.
- How could this be?

39:32.690 --> 39:33.730
How could this be?

39:33.730 --> 39:34.580
Our people have been

39:34.580 --> 39:36.370
at A Goose to Return for so long.

39:36.730 --> 39:38.580
The news can't be wrong.

39:38.900 --> 39:40.290
Yu Qi is really dead.

39:46.380 --> 39:48.970
Mentor, the Grand Princess
and her daughter

39:48.970 --> 39:50.440
killed my family and my husband.

39:50.460 --> 39:51.810
I want to join you

39:51.810 --> 39:53.080
in attacking Changle Palace.

39:53.100 --> 39:54.480
I'll kill them

39:54.500 --> 39:55.690
to avenge my family

39:55.690 --> 39:57.700
and husband.

40:08.690 --> 40:10.330
Jiang Si.

40:10.580 --> 40:12.620
You're not dead.

40:14.130 --> 40:16.580
You're the Saintess of Nanwu.

40:16.980 --> 40:18.770
I'm not the Saintess of Nanwu.

40:19.380 --> 40:21.370
I'm here for revenge.

40:24.900 --> 40:26.730
The entire court

40:27.060 --> 40:29.540
is under my command

40:32.620 --> 40:34.700
and won't tolerate your insolence.

40:35.210 --> 40:37.020
Then today,

40:37.210 --> 40:39.190
we'll see whether it's your command

40:39.210 --> 40:41.450
or my sword that decides this.

40:45.940 --> 40:47.300
This

40:47.330 --> 40:49.220
is for my family.

40:49.540 --> 40:50.900
You and your daughter Cui Mingyue

40:50.900 --> 40:52.520
have killed innocents.

40:52.540 --> 40:55.170
My father, brother, and sister

40:55.170 --> 40:57.920
all suffered and died because of you.

40:57.940 --> 40:59.300
Today,

40:59.560 --> 41:01.960
I will avenge them.

41:02.980 --> 41:04.410
This

41:04.730 --> 41:06.810
is for my husband,

41:07.850 --> 41:09.250
Yu Qi.

41:12.770 --> 41:15.160
Why did you have to kill him too?

41:17.100 --> 41:18.580
Do you think

41:19.380 --> 41:22.250
he was just the Yu Qi you knew?

41:26.380 --> 41:28.290
Even if I die,

41:29.250 --> 41:32.360
your life will never change.

41:32.380 --> 41:33.740
Shut up!

41:38.100 --> 41:40.140
I was born and raised

41:40.730 --> 41:42.700
in Dazhou,

41:43.460 --> 41:44.620
but you and your daughter

41:44.620 --> 41:46.670
wanted to wipe me out,

41:46.690 --> 41:49.850
leaving me no place in Dazhou.

41:50.100 --> 41:51.700
This

41:52.460 --> 41:54.100
is for myself.

42:30.730 --> 42:32.890
I finally had my revenge.

42:34.850 --> 42:36.450
I finally had my revenge.

42:37.330 --> 42:38.770
(Now, )

42:38.940 --> 42:41.450
(Zhan, Father, )

42:41.770 --> 42:43.110
(and Yi)

42:43.130 --> 42:44.810
(are safe and sound.)

42:44.900 --> 42:47.290
(Maybe I'm no longer a jinx, )

42:48.210 --> 42:50.020
(and Yu Qi will be safe too.)

42:50.040 --> 42:54.160
(The End of Episode 19)
(Should I miss him again?)

